<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk.Web">

  <!-- ========================================================================
       Single-process RemoteBoundary demo.

       Stands up a minimal WebApplication on http://localhost:5390 that hosts
       the /_pragmatic/invoke endpoint with a hand-rolled handler for
       CalculateTaxAction. Then constructs an HttpActionInvoker pointing at the
       same address and issues three invocations (success, server-side error,
       unroutable action) so the console output shows the full request /
       response lifecycle including the RemoteError wire format.

       For the end-to-end story with full Composition / SG / [RemoteBoundary]
       attribute wiring, see examples/showcase/src/Showcase.Host.Distributed
       together with Showcase.Billing.Host in the showcase solution.
       ======================================================================== -->

